{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Desktop Fidget</strong></i>\u00a0is your interactive desktop toybox, packed <strong>with over 20 quirky fidgets</strong> to click, drag, and toss around. It\u2019s made to sit right next to your everyday work or gaming, turning your desktop into a cozy space where stress melts away and creativity gets a little boost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fe3b76e92228f34b9dfef5ffbdd6b36d.poster.avif?t=1758187988\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fe3b76e92228f34b9dfef5ffbdd6b36d.webm?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fe3b76e92228f34b9dfef5ffbdd6b36d.mp4?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/a3f2ead2780d3527bb390f23985661b0.avif?t=1758187988\" width=608 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling tense? Just <strong>click, drag, spin, or mash</strong> your favorite fidgets to blow off steam. Every tap is oddly satisfying, like popping bubble wrap, but better. These small actions help <strong>keep your hands active</strong> and <strong>your mind calm</strong> during long hours at the computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/4de0ba3f276b59f9ad4c054f6563e774.poster.avif?t=1758187988\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/4de0ba3f276b59f9ad4c054f6563e774.webm?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/4de0ba3f276b59f9ad4c054f6563e774.mp4?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/d500bb68cfbd689962389e8ec87c49e0.avif?t=1758187988\" width=608 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These fidgets aren't just for show, they <strong>react to you</strong>. <strong>Blow into your mic</strong> to inflate a virtual bag, or <strong>connect your camera</strong> to turn a fidget into a goofy mirror.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/7d51411de657f328beff58fb1ebea1d8.poster.avif?t=1758187988\" width=800 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/7d51411de657f328beff58fb1ebea1d8.webm?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/7d51411de657f328beff58fb1ebea1d8.mp4?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/4302078ffc2176636232a1669a9e2b28.avif?t=1758187988\" width=608 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resize, move, and arrange</strong> your fidgets however you like. Create your own personal chaos, or harmony right on your screen. It\u2019s your space. Make it fidget-worthy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fa177fa9878093a568a8e584d6be06ea.poster.avif?t=1758187988\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fa177fa9878093a568a8e584d6be06ea.webm?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fa177fa9878093a568a8e584d6be06ea.mp4?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUG REPORT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/27fc3adde8d085eeb70b7923556ea845.avif?t=1758187988\" width=1560 height=496 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter any issues or bugs while playing the game, reporting them through 'Discord' allows for faster resolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can join 'Discord' via the link on the Steam store page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3759380?t=1758187988","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/fbe03aa9e01c52f498584803dd63833b4832918f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758187988","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/300dfd97d46b6eefe77ca38e46b0a0b0f61a6a72/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758187988","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/300dfd97d46b6eefe77ca38e46b0a0b0f61a6a72/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758187988","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3864560,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Desktop Fidget</strong></i>\u00a0is your interactive desktop toybox, packed <strong>with over 20 quirky fidgets</strong> to click, drag, and toss around. It\u2019s made to sit right next to your everyday work or gaming, turning your desktop into a cozy space where stress melts away and creativity gets a little boost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fe3b76e92228f34b9dfef5ffbdd6b36d.poster.avif?t=1758187988\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fe3b76e92228f34b9dfef5ffbdd6b36d.webm?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fe3b76e92228f34b9dfef5ffbdd6b36d.mp4?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/a3f2ead2780d3527bb390f23985661b0.avif?t=1758187988\" width=608 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling tense? Just <strong>click, drag, spin, or mash</strong> your favorite fidgets to blow off steam. Every tap is oddly satisfying, like popping bubble wrap, but better. These small actions help <strong>keep your hands active</strong> and <strong>your mind calm</strong> during long hours at the computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/4de0ba3f276b59f9ad4c054f6563e774.poster.avif?t=1758187988\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/4de0ba3f276b59f9ad4c054f6563e774.webm?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/4de0ba3f276b59f9ad4c054f6563e774.mp4?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/d500bb68cfbd689962389e8ec87c49e0.avif?t=1758187988\" width=608 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These fidgets aren't just for show, they <strong>react to you</strong>. <strong>Blow into your mic</strong> to inflate a virtual bag, or <strong>connect your camera</strong> to turn a fidget into a goofy mirror.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/7d51411de657f328beff58fb1ebea1d8.poster.avif?t=1758187988\" width=800 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/7d51411de657f328beff58fb1ebea1d8.webm?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/7d51411de657f328beff58fb1ebea1d8.mp4?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/4302078ffc2176636232a1669a9e2b28.avif?t=1758187988\" width=608 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resize, move, and arrange</strong> your fidgets however you like. Create your own personal chaos, or harmony right on your screen. It\u2019s your space. Make it fidget-worthy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fa177fa9878093a568a8e584d6be06ea.poster.avif?t=1758187988\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fa177fa9878093a568a8e584d6be06ea.webm?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fa177fa9878093a568a8e584d6be06ea.mp4?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUG REPORT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/27fc3adde8d085eeb70b7923556ea845.avif?t=1758187988\" width=1560 height=496 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter any issues or bugs while playing the game, reporting them through 'Discord' allows for faster resolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can join 'Discord' via the link on the Steam store page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["BITCOVER"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/d5f3eee971d748a7ed58a5d080d9533f9a5b7642/header.jpg?t=1758187988","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3759380/1631352502/aac12bb02d9a8231cf035c07129cd06e47d233c2/1750383978/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751617735","da